    "description": "A charming collection of Nintendo-themed toy figures featuring Mario, Luigi, and Peach, each designed with a blocky, stylized aesthetic reminiscent of classic video game characters. These figures are shown both assembled in their green pipe bases and as individual pieces, highlighting their modular design and collectible appeal. The set includes two small enemy blocks and a question mark block, adding to the interactive play value. The figures are in excellent condition with vibrant colors and clear character details.\nMaterial: Plastic\nColor: Green pipes, Mario (red/white), Luigi (green), Peach (pink), blocks (brown/yellow)\nKey features: Modular design, includes pipes, enemy blocks, question mark block, stylized character design\nCondition:\nAll figures and accessories show no visible damage or wear. Please see photos for details.\nProcessor notes:\nMario powers on & makes noises. Luigi & Princess Peach have not been tested.\nDisclaimer: Please note that all items have been donated. All items are used and untested. All items are not Authenticated. Unless otherwise notated all autographed items have not been authenticated by a third party. We do our best to ensure the quality of all our auctions & describe them accurately; however, we are not experts in any field. Items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nAll items are sold AS IS.\nPlease read our policies below before placing your bid\nThank you for bidding on an item from Goodwill Serving Southern Los Angeles County. 88 cents from every dollar raised goes to funding our mission to help people in our community with barriers to employment.\nPlease see images for further detail and please ask any questions you may have\nbefore\nmaking a bid.\nWhen purchasing a pick-up only item, you have 10 days to pick up after payment, after which, your item will be donated back to Goodwill with no refund given.\nIf Approved for return, Refunds will not be given on shipping and handling charges.\nNote: Any extra props (i.e., stands, mannequins, shoe horns etc.) are not part of the auction and are for presentation purposes only.\nWe appreciate your support.\nGoodwill SOLAC",
